{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46650","headline":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见秋扇 · 齐己","name":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见秋扇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病起见秋扇，风前悟感伤。\n念予当咽绝，得尔致清凉。\n沙鹭如摇影，汀莲似绽香。\n不同婕妤咏，托意怨君王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46650.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46650","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}